The task that will perform the calculation of the total number of bottles recycled on Saturday and Monday is "CalculateTotal". This task should be added to the TG as follows:

1. Add a new task called "CalculateTotal" in the "tasks" section.
2. Update the "orders" section to include a transition from "ExtractData" to "CalculateTotal".

Here's how the updated TG would look:

```json
{
    "owner_agent": "ProbStat",
    "tasks": {
        "ExtractData": "Extract the number of bottles recycled on Saturday and Monday from the provided table.",
        "CalculateTotal": "Calculate the total number of bottles recycled on Saturday and Monday."
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "ExtractData",
            "to": "CalculateTotal"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```

The "CalculateTotal" task will take the extracted values for Saturday and Monday, add them together, and provide the total number of bottles recycled on those two days.
